## Key Technical Rules
- Never hardcode Stripe Price IDs — use environment variables
- Always test checkout after updating any Price ID
- Supabase auth: email/password, confirmation OFF
- mcp.json is gitignored — never commit it
- .env.local is gitignored — never commit it
- After code changes: test locally with npm run dev, then push to GitHub (Vercel auto-deploys)
- Videos weighted 2x text units for operational reasons — do NOT display this on pricing cards

## Session End Command
npm run sync
Then commit and push to GitHub with a descriptive commit message.

